Parts under the Apache License 2.0
----------------------------------

This repository began as a fork of phprs (https://github.com/yingkitw/phprs,
Apache License 2.0). The original interpreter has been replaced; the current
VM (crates/vm), JIT (crates/jit), framework (crates/framework) and module
manager (crates/pkg) are new code licensed under the AGPL-3.0-or-later as
stated above. The following files still come from phprs and remain under the
Apache License 2.0 (text in LICENSE-APACHE); each carries an
`SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0` notice:

- crates/vm/tests/probes/legacy_*.grd — 157 test scripts harvested from the
  phprs test suite (their `.out` files hold the output of PHP 8.4 and are
  not derived from phprs);
- .cargo/config.toml — the build configuration (machine-specific settings
  removed).

Loco (https://github.com/loco-rs/loco, Apache License 2.0) is used as a
dependency; crates/framework/src/app.rs implements its `Hooks` trait against
the documented signature. No Loco source code was copied.

Comparison applications of the benchmark (bench/*-app)
-------------------------------------------------------

The applications under bench/ were generated from the starter kits of the
frameworks they compare (Laravel, AdonisJS, Goravel, Rails, FastAPI, Spring
Boot, ASP.NET Core, Phoenix) and keep the licenses of those starter kits
(MIT or equivalent; see the LICENSE file inside an app where the starter
kit ships one). The benchmark endpoints added to them are part of OpenGrid
and licensed under the AGPL-3.0-or-later.
